# OFFICIAL GGG PoE2 tree export (github.com/grindinggear/poe2-skilltree-export)
# — the authoritative source. _ggg-tree.json = data.json (nodes have precomputed
# x/y + explicit edges); _ggg-assets/ = the sprite-sheet atlases (skills, frame,
# group-background, mastery-effect, line, class backgrounds) + their coord JSONs.
# Build inputs, not loaded raw at runtime. Supersedes the PoB2 fork below.
_ggg-tree.json
_ggg-assets/
# PoB2 0.4 fork — prior source; superseded by the official GGG export above.
_pob2-tree.json
# Reference data, no longer consumed by the build:
#   tree-source.json   — RePoE-fork (original geometry lineage of tree-data.json)
#   tree-official.json — PoE1 tree
#   _pttree.json       — PoE1 tree GitHub listing
tree-source.json
tree-official.json
_pttree.json
